,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"“Hmm, tobacco you say? Well, I do enjoy an evening roll from time to time, though, it’s been quite a while since I've been on a sea voyage. Could I… could I wear a very small hat and play an accordion?”","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.736,"end":17.536,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":41},"large":{"start":0.736,"end":17.38,"frac":0.976,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":41},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Yes, yes, YES!! You know better than to mess up this opportunity.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":17.856,"end":21.92,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":12},"large":{"start":17.856,"end":21.92,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"\"Then we have an accord Captain, and you shall find me at your disposal.\" The monkey bows solemnly. \"You may call me, Mr Boots.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":22.56,"end":32.8,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":24},"large":{"start":22.56,"end":32.54,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":24},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"This is the greatest day ever. With Mr. Boots added to your crew, you’re one step closer to setting sail with a lucky charm. You have time to scour the city once more before you lift anchor–but best be quick! There may be more librarians hunting you, and Neckbeard's out there rounding up his own crew and gear.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":33.568,"end":52.224,"frac":0.983,"status":"ok","matched":58,"words":59},"large":{"start":33.568,"end":52.224,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":59,"words":59},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"Open your checklist. What will be your last stop?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":52.672,"end":55.8,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":9},"large":{"start":52.672,"end":55.808,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"Head to the local legal establishment? Pirates may not like courtrooms but they're a fine place to find scoundrels who may be amenable to the idea of a quick trip far away.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":56.512,"end":66.048,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":32},"large":{"start":56.512,"end":66.048,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":32},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"Or","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":66.56,"end":66.88,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"large":{"start":66.56,"end":66.74,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"Head to the local store, where you can get a spare set of sails you're likely to need for the journey? Neckbeard is notorious for shooting cannon balls through those vital pieces of fabric, you need to be prepared.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":67.456,"end":79.296,"frac":0.974,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":39},"large":{"start":67.456,"end":79.296,"frac":0.974,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":39},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68fbf3576e6cd_JM7.jpg"}